flowchart LR
  subgraph ATK[Attack]
    direction TB
    A1[① Avoid]
    A2[② Disguise]
    A3[③ Deceive]
    A4[④ Hijack]
    A5[⑤ Probe]
    A6[⑥ Disrupt]
  end
  subgraph DEF[Matching defense]
    direction TB
    D1[Inventory every path to authorization<br/>use exemptions and MIT flags by the rules]
    D2[Check that device, network and behavior<br/>are consistent, not one signal alone]
    D3[Move to phishing resistant methods<br/>such as in app confirmation and biometrics]
    D4[Set an observation period<br/>for newly bound cards and tokens]
    D5[Bot detection and rate limits<br/>before authentication<br/>one generic failure message]
    D6[Block on error for high risk payments<br/>monitor error rates and alert]
  end
  A1 --> D1
  A2 --> D2
  A3 --> D3
  A4 --> D4
  A5 --> D5
  A6 --> D6
